librust-proxmox-systemd-dev (1.0.1-1+supermox1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * SuperMox's own copy of the Debianized Rust crate "proxmox-systemd"
    (upstream crate version 1.0.1), packaged unchanged as a native source
    package so later tasks can replace its libsystemd calls.
  * The libsystemd-dev dependency is dropped from Depends; the crate's
    libsystemd FFI calls are left untouched in this task.

